WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.626 --> 00:00:02.336
(Lobby chatter)

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:04.546
(Phone ringing)

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:06.757
(Lobby chatter)

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:08.884
(Phone ringing)

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:15.015
Cherry:
I'm 23 years old and...

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:15.766
(Desk bell ringing)

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:17.935
Cherry:
...sometimes I wonder if life
was wasted on me?

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:22.022
♪♪

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.857
Cherry: 
I take all the beautiful things
to heart.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.442
♪♪

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:26.860
Cherry:
Til I about die from it. 

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:31.198
(Clicking)

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:36.662
♪ If I could save time in a
bottle ♪

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:39.623
♪ The first thing ♪
Cherry:
Hey, I'm really happy you're here. 

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:40.624
Emily: 
Why's that?

00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:41.833
Cause I like you.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:45.087
♪ But there never seems to be
enough time to do ♪

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:46.129
You're it for me.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.423
I feel the same way.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.883
Cherry: 
I joined the army.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:50.884
Emily:
Why would you do that?

00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:54.638
Cherry:
Sometimes I feel like I've
already seen everything that's gonna happen.

00:00:54.638 --> 00:00:56.181
♪♪

00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:57.766
(click sound, pill sound and
money machine sound)

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:58.267
(Police sirens)

00:00:58.267 --> 00:00:59.601
(Smashing sound)

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:00.936
Cherry:
And it's a nightmare.

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:04.606
♪♪

00:01:04.606 --> 00:01:06.483
(Argh)
(Heavy breathing)

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:10.404
♪♪

00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:12.364
Cherry:
My one true accomplishment was
not dying.

00:01:12.364 --> 00:01:13.824
♪♪

00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:15.450
Army man:
Move, back up!

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.870
I have this noise in my head.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.455
It'll stop.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:22.040
Emily:
One day it will go quiet.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.376
Cherry:
I don't imagine that anyone goes
in for a robbery

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:27.129
Cherry:
if they're not in some
kind of desperation.

00:01:27.129 --> 00:01:28.672
Cherry:
I've been at this a while now,

00:01:28.672 --> 00:01:30.674
and it's no secret what my face
looks like.

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:33.635
(Gun shot) (Alarm sounds)
-Get on the ground!

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:36.054
Cherry:
The one thing about robbing
banks is you're mostly robbing women.

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:38.223
Cherry:
So the last thing you
want to be is rude.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:40.475
Ma'am, it's nothing personal.

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:43.061
♪ There never seems to be enough
time ♪

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:45.689
♪ To do the things I want to
do, once you find them ♪

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:48.567
♪ Once you find them ♪

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.068
You're gonna make it through
this.

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:51.778
Emily:
I love you.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:54.698
Cherry:
Can you look back to when you
met the one you love the most.

00:01:54.698 --> 00:01:56.700
♪ Through time with ♪

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.368
Cherry:
And remember exactly how it was.

00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:02.080
♪ Through time with ♪

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.583
Cherry:
What you saw in her that made
you say yes.

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:06.209
Cherry:
This is what I came here for.

00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:10.213
(Screaming)

00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:13.842
Cherry:
Sometimes I feel like I've
already seen everything that's gonna happen.

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:14.718
(Clink)

00:02:14.718 --> 00:02:15.761
Cherry:
And it's a nightmare.

00:02:15.761 --> 00:02:30.150
♪♪

